<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/global.css">
    <title>Ensine Conosco - EHS</title>
    <style>
        .teacher-hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--cor-fundo), var(--cor-fundo-alt));
            padding: var(--sp-16) 0;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--cor-borda);
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 var(--sp-4);
        }

        .hero-content h1 {
            font-size: var(--fs-4xl);
            margin-bottom: var(--sp-4);
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #fff, var(--cor-acento));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .hero-content p {
            font-size: var(--fs-lg);
            color: var(--cor-texto-secundario);
            margin-bottom: var(--sp-8);
        }

        .benefits-section {
            padding: var(--sp-16) 0;
            background-color: var(--cor-fundo);
        }

        .benefits-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: var(--sp-8);
            max-width: var(--max-width);
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 var(--sp-4);
        }

        .benefit-card {
            background: var(--cor-superficie);
            padding: var(--sp-8);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid var(--cor-borda);
            transition: transform var(--transition-base);
        }

        .benefit-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: var(--cor-acento);
        }

        .icon-circle {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            background: var(--cor-acento-light);
            color: var(--cor-acento);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 24px;
            margin: 0 auto var(--sp-4);
        }

        .application-section {
            padding: var(--sp-16) 0;
            background-color: var(--cor-fundo-alt);
        }

        .form-wrapper {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: var(--cor-superficie);
            padding: var(--sp-10);
            border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
            border: 1px solid var(--cor-borda);
        }

        .form-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: var(--sp-10);
        }

        .form-header h2 {
            font-size: var(--fs-3xl);
            margin-bottom: var(--sp-2);
        }

        .input-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: var(--sp-6);
            margin-bottom: var(--sp-6);
        }

        .lists-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: var(--sp-6);
            margin-bottom: var(--sp-8);
        }

        .input-action-group {
            display: flex;
            gap: var(--sp-2);
        }

        .add-btn {
            background: var(--cor-acento);
            color: white;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            width: 45px;
            height: 45px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .item-list {
            margin-top: var(--sp-4);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: var(--sp-2);
        }

        .item-list li {
            background: var(--cor-fundo);
            padding: var(--sp-2) var(--sp-4);
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: var(--fs-sm);
            border: 1px solid var(--cor-borda);
            animation: slideInUp 0.3s ease;
        }

        .delete-btn {
            color: var(--cor-erro);
            background: transparent;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .input-row, .lists-container {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .form-wrapper {
                padding: var(--sp-6);
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('common/header') -%>

    <header class="teacher-hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h1>Compartilhe seu conhecimento. Inspire o futuro.</h1>
            <p>Junte-se a uma comunidade exclusiva de especialistas. Transforme sua paixão em cursos incríveis e impacte a vida de milhares de alunos ao redor do mundo.</p>
            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" onclick="document.getElementById('application-section').scrollIntoView({behavior: 'smooth'})">
                Quero me candidatar
            </button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="benefits-section">
        <div class="benefits-container">
            <div class="benefit-card">
                <div class="icon-circle"><i class="fas fa-globe"></i></div>
                <h3>Alcance Global</h3>
                <p class="text-secondary">Sua voz pode chegar a alunos em qualquer lugar do mundo. Construa sua marca pessoal em nossa plataforma.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="benefit-card">
                <div class="icon-circle"><i class="fas fa-wallet"></i></div>
                <h3>Ótima Remuneração</h3>
                <p class="text-secondary">Crie uma nova fonte de renda passiva com seus cursos enquanto foca no que faz de melhor: Ensinar.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="benefit-card">
                <div class="icon-circle"><i class="fas fa-tools"></i></div>
                <h3>Ferramentas Incluídas</h3>
                <p class="text-secondary">Gere certificados, acompanhe métricas de alunos e grave aulas sem dores de cabeça com nossa infraestrutura.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="application-section" id="application-section">
        <div class="form-wrapper">
            <div class="form-header">
                <h2>Formulário de Aplicação</h2>
                <p class="text-secondary">Preencha os dados abaixo. Nossa aprovação agora é <strong>automática</strong> para que você comece a ensinar hoje mesmo!</p>
            </div>

            <form id="profile-form" class="form-dark">
                <div class="input-row">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="specialty">Área de Especialidade Principal</label>
                        <input type="text" id="specialty" placeholder="Ex: Engenharia de Software" required>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="linkedin">Perfil do LinkedIn</label>
                        <input type="url" id="linkedin" placeholder="https://linkedin.com/in/seu-perfil" required>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="bio">Resumo Profissional (Bio)</label>
                    <textarea id="bio" name="bio" rows="4" placeholder="Conte-nos brevemente sobre sua jornada profissional..." required></textarea>
                </div>

                <div class="lists-container">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="experience-input">Experiências Profissionais</label>
                        <div class="input-action-group">
                            <input type="text" id="experience-input" placeholder="Ex: Tech Lead na Empresa">
                            <button type="button" class="add-btn" id="add-experience-btn"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></button>
                        </div>
                        <ul id="experience-list" class="item-list"></ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="certificate-input">Formações e Certificações</label>
                        <div class="input-action-group">
                            <input type="text" id="certificate-input" placeholder="Ex: Bacharel em Ciência da Computação">
                            <button type="button" class="add-btn" id="add-certificate-btn"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></button>
                        </div>
                        <ul id="certificate-list" class="item-list"></ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-block btn-lg submit-btn">
                    <i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i> Enviar Candidatura
                </button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </section>

    <%- include('common/footer') -%>

    <!-- Form Logic -->
    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {

            function setupDynamicList(buttonId, inputId, listId) {
                const addButton = document.getElementById(buttonId);
                const inputField = document.getElementById(inputId);
                const list = document.getElementById(listId);

                // Add on Click
                addButton.addEventListener('click', () => addElement());

                // Add on Enter key
                inputField.addEventListener('keypress', (e) => {
                    if (e.key === 'Enter') {
                        e.preventDefault();
                        addElement();
                    }
                });

                function addElement() {
                    const text = inputField.value.trim();
                    if (text === "") return;

                    const li = document.createElement('li');
                    
                    const span = document.createElement('span');
                    span.textContent = text;
                    
                    const deleteButton = document.createElement('button');
                    deleteButton.innerHTML = '<i class="fas fa-times"></i>';
                    deleteButton.className = 'delete-btn';
                    deleteButton.type = 'button'; 

                    deleteButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
                        li.style.transform = 'scale(0.95)';
                        li.style.opacity = '0';
                        setTimeout(() => li.remove(), 200);
                    });

                    li.appendChild(span);
                    li.appendChild(deleteButton);
                    list.appendChild(li);

                    inputField.value = '';
                    inputField.focus();
                }
            }

            setupDynamicList('add-experience-btn', 'experience-input', 'experience-list');
            setupDynamicList('add-certificate-btn', 'certificate-input', 'certificate-list');

            const form = document.getElementById('profile-form');
            form.addEventListener('submit', (event) => {
                event.preventDefault(); 

                const specialty = document.getElementById('specialty').value;
                const linkedin = document.getElementById('linkedin').value;
                const bio = document.getElementById('bio').value;
                const experiences = collectListData('experience-list');
                const certificates = collectListData('certificate-list');

                const formData = {
                    specialty,
                    linkedin,
                    bio,
                    professionalExperiences: experiences,
                    certifications: certificates
                };

                // Form data to be sent
                const payload = {
                    userId: '<%= user.id %>',
                    specialty,
                    linkedin,
                    bio,
                    professionalExperiences: experiences,
                    certifications: certificates
                };

                const btn = document.querySelector('.submit-btn');
                const originalText = btn.innerHTML;
                btn.innerHTML = '<i class="fas fa-circle-notch fa-spin"></i> Enviando...';
                btn.disabled = true;

                fetch('/api/professors/apply', {
                    method: 'POST',
                    headers: {
                        'Content-Type': 'application/json'
                    },
                    body: JSON.stringify(payload)
                })
                .then(response => response.json().then(data => ({ status: response.status, body: data })))
                .then(({ status, body }) => {
                    if (status !== 200) {
                        throw new Error(body.error || 'Erro desconhecido');
                    }
                    btn.innerHTML = '<i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Candidatura Aprovada!';
                    btn.style.backgroundColor = '#2ecc71';
                    
                    setTimeout(() => {
                        window.location.href = '/teacherScene';
                    }, 1500);
                })
                .catch(error => {
                    alert('Erro ao enviar candidatura: ' + error.message);
                    btn.innerHTML = originalText;
                    btn.style.backgroundColor = '';
                    btn.disabled = false;
                });
            });

            function collectListData(listId) {
                const list = document.getElementById(listId);
                const items = [];
                list.querySelectorAll('li span').forEach(item => items.push(item.textContent));
                return items;
            }
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>